  "Length": 10800,
  "Description": "Techno to jam on, at a hundred and twenty-eight: a groove that runs on its own and twenty-four panel knobs that arrange it \u2014 kick, rumble, hats, clap, a rolling bass and an acid line in four patterns, a DJ filter, echo, room and crush. Under C3 a key moves the groove to its key at the next bar, and held it builds to a drop on release; from C3 up four voices play chord stabs that bloom into pads wh",
  "Author": "Flyback",
  "Tags": [
    "techno",
    "acid",
    "playable",
    "knobs",
    "live",
    "drums"
  ]
}